{"id": 2871, "title": "Don’t Forget to Cheer for Yourself", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "dont-forget-to-cheer-for-yourself", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2871_dont-forget-to-cheer-for-yourself.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["生活中，我们经常为别人喝彩，那你是否想到过为自己喝彩？", "有一个4岁的小女孩，她非常喜欢画画，家里的墙壁都被她涂得乱七八糟的。她的妈妈没办法，只好给她留了一个专门画画的地方，但她还是常常在那个范围之外画。妈妈生气地说：”听话，不然，无论你画得多好，爸爸妈妈也不会表扬你了！”小女孩还满脸的不在乎，说：”我自己可以表扬自己！”", "女孩虽小，然而说出来的话却很有道理。在自己的人生舞台上，每个人都是主角。在现实生活中，也许你现在还默默无闻，但是如果你保持一种平稳的心态，多为自己喝彩，并且坚持下去，那么总有一天你会成功的。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["生活中，我們經常為別人喝彩，那你是否想到過為自己喝彩？", "有一個4歲的小女孩，她非常喜歡畫畫，家裡的牆壁都被她塗得亂七八糟的。她的媽媽沒辦法，只好給她留了一個專門畫畫的地方，但她還是常常在那個範圍之外畫。媽媽生氣地說：”聽話，不然，無論你畫得多好，爸爸媽媽也不會表揚你了！”小女孩還滿臉的不在乎，說：”我自己可以表揚自己！”", "女孩雖小，然而說出來的話卻很有道理。在自己的人生舞臺上，每個人都是主角。在現實生活中，也許你現在還默默無聞，但是如果你保持一種平穩的心態，多為自己喝彩，並且堅持下去，那麼總有一天你會成功的。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["shēng huó zhōng， wǒ men jīng cháng wèi bié rén hè cǎi， nà nǐ shì fǒu xiǎng dào guo wèi zì jǐ hè cǎi？", "yǒu yī gè 4 suì de xiǎo nǚ hái， tā fēi cháng xǐ huan huà huà， jiā lǐ de qiáng bì dōu bèi tā tú de luàn qī bā zāo de。 tā de mā ma méi bàn fǎ， zhǐ hǎo gěi tā liú le yī gè zhuān mén huà huà de dì fang， dàn tā hái shi cháng cháng zài nà gè fàn wéi zhī wài huà。 mā ma shēng qì de shuō：” tīng huà， bù rán， wú lùn nǐ huà de duō hǎo， bà ba mā ma yě bù huì biǎo yáng nǐ le！” xiǎo nǚ hái hái mǎn liǎn de bù zài hu， shuō：” wǒ zì jǐ kě yǐ biǎo yáng zì jǐ！”", "nǚ hái suī xiǎo， rán ér shuō chu lai de huà què hěn yǒu dào lǐ。 zài zì jǐ de rén shēng wǔ tái shàng， měi gè rén dōu shì zhǔ jué。 zài xiàn shí shēng huó zhōng， yě xǔ nǐ xiàn zài hái mò mò wú wén， dàn shì rú guǒ nǐ bǎo chí yī zhǒng píng wěn de xīn tài， duō wèi zì jǐ hè cǎi， bìng qiě jiān chí xià qù， nà me zǒng yǒu yī tiān nǐ huì chéng gōng de。"], "english_paragraphs": ["In life, we often cheer for others. But have you ever thought of cheering for yourself?", "There was a four-year-old girl who loved drawing. She had scribbled all over the walls at home, leaving them a mess. Her mother had no choice but to set aside a special place for her to draw, but the girl still often drew outside that area. Her mother said angrily, “Do as you’re told, or no matter how well you draw, your dad and I won’t praise you anymore!” The little girl looked completely unconcerned and said, “I can praise myself!”", "Though the girl was young, what she said made a lot of sense. Each of us is the main character on the stage of our own life. In the real world, you may still be unknown, but if you keep a balanced outlook, cheer yourself on more often, and persevere, you will succeed one day."], "english_full": "In life, we often cheer for others. But have you ever thought of cheering for yourself?\n\nThere was a four-year-old girl who loved drawing. She had scribbled all over the walls at home, leaving them a mess. Her mother had no choice but to set aside a special place for her to draw, but the girl still often drew outside that area. Her mother said angrily, “Do as you’re told, or no matter how well you draw, your dad and I won’t praise you anymore!” The little girl looked completely unconcerned and said, “I can praise myself!”\n\nThough the girl was young, what she said made a lot of sense. Each of us is the main character on the stage of our own life. In the real world, you may still be unknown, but if you keep a balanced outlook, cheer yourself on more often, and persevere, you will succeed one day.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shēng huó\" data-defn=\"life / livelihood\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhōng\" data-defn=\"within; among; in\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">中</span><span class=\"tr\">中</span><rt>zhōng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ men\" data-defn=\"we; us; ourselves; our\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīng cháng\" data-defn=\"frequently; constantly; regularly; often\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi\" data-defn=\"because of / for / to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">为</span><span class=\"tr\">為</span><rt>wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bié rén\" data-defn=\"other people; others; other person\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">别人</span><span class=\"tr\">別人</span><rt>bié rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hè cǎi\" data-defn=\"to acclaim / to cheer\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">喝彩</span><span class=\"tr\">喝彩</span><rt>hè cǎi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"then (in that case)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì fǒu\" data-defn=\"whether (or not) / if / is or isn&#x27;t\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">是否</span><span class=\"tr\">是否</span><rt>shì fǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng dào\" data-defn=\"to think of / to call to mind / to anticipate\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">想到</span><span class=\"tr\">想到</span><rt>xiǎng dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"guo\" data-defn=\"(experienced action marker)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi\" data-defn=\"because of / for / to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">为</span><span class=\"tr\">為</span><rt>wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zì jǐ\" data-defn=\"oneself; (attributive) one&#x27;s own\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">自己</span><span class=\"tr\">自己</span><rt>zì jǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hè cǎi\" data-defn=\"to acclaim / to cheer\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">喝彩</span><span class=\"tr\">喝彩</span><rt>hè cǎi</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">4</span><span class=\"tr\">4</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"suì\" data-defn=\"classifier for years (of age)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo\" data-defn=\"young\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ hái\" data-defn=\"girl; lass\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">女孩</span><span class=\"tr\">女孩</span><rt>nǚ hái</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fēi cháng\" data-defn=\"very; really\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">非常</span><span class=\"tr\">非常</span><rt>fēi cháng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to lik