ata-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">办法</span><span class=\"tr\">辦法</span><rt>bàn fǎ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhǐ hǎo\" data-defn=\"to have no other option but to ...; to have to; to be forced to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">只好</span><span class=\"tr\">只好</span><rt>zhǐ hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gěi\" data-defn=\"to / for / for the benefit of / to do sth (for sb)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liú\" data-defn=\"to retain / to keep / to preserve\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">留</span><span class=\"tr\">留</span><rt>liú</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhuān mén\" data-defn=\"specially; specifically (for a particular purpose)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">专门</span><span class=\"tr\">專門</span><rt>zhuān mén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huà\" data-defn=\"to draw; to paint / to draw (a line)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">画</span><span class=\"tr\">畫</span><rt>huà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huà\" data-defn=\"to draw; to paint / to draw (a line)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">画</span><span c